    Algorithm-citation declaration:
      algorithm: per-function structural extraction +
                           componentwise N-ary join over Return
                           terminators; finite-fold with
                           CONSERVATIVE seed for the empty case;
                           independent AND-monoids for preserves_freshness and
                           returns_fresh_self_alloc +
                           max-join for the lattice dims +
                           ShapeClass-join for shape
      published basis: Birkhoff, G., "Lattice Theory",
                           3rd ed., American Mathematical
                           Society Colloquium Publications,
                           vol. XXV, 1967, §I.5 (totally-ordered
                           chains under max), §V (product
                           lattices); Cousot & Cousot, "Abstract
                           Interpretation: A Unified Lattice
                           Model for Static Analysis of Programs
                           by Construction or Approximation of
                           Fixpoints", POPL 1977 (interprocedural
                           summary computation via SCC-
                           topological monotone iteration with
                           componentwise lattice joins);
                           Tarski, A., "A lattice-theoretical
                           fixpoint theorem and its
                           applications", Pacific Journal of
                           Mathematics, vol. 5, no. 2,
                           pp. 285-309, 1955 (least-fixpoint of
                           monotone function on complete
                           lattice)
      complexity: O(R + L) per function, where R is
                           the number of Return terminators and
                           L is the maximum Let-chain depth
                           (recursive var_uniqueness tracing
                           through Let { Var(v) } aliases per
                           §AIMS §7 "Tracing rules" bullet 1);
                           O(param_count × call_site_count ×
                           height_sum) total per SCC convergence
                           per IC-7's bound
      determinism: deterministic; structural classification
                           is a pure function of the ArcFunction
                           IR + ContractMap; block visitation
                           order in `func.blocks` is consistent
                           across compilation runs (Salsa-stable);
                           commutativity (L-1) + associativity
                           (L-2) ensure fold-order independence
                           per sec-6 IA-9
      reference impl: `extract_return_info` at
                           compiler/ori_arc/src/
                           aims/interprocedural/extract.rs lines
                           790-839; recursive helper
                           `var_uniqueness` lines 844-913;
                           invoked from `extract_contract` line
                           144 inside
                           ori_arc::aims::interprocedural::
                           analyze_program SCC-fixpoint loop
      cross-language Lean 4 src/Lean/Compiler/IR/Borrow.lean
      prior art: computes per-function return-borrowing
